# Runtime configuration and private deployment state never belong in Git.
**/secrets/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/*.env.example
**/.state/
**/.local/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/*.dump

.development/

# Legacy workstation preview artifacts stay outside the source repository.
/*.png
/*.html

.development-original-capture/
